        "official_en": "Dammit... I <text style=\"italic\">elixired</> when I should’ve <text style=\"italic\">megalixired</>. I would’ve had the fight if I did.",
        "real_en": "If that Elixir had been a Last Elixir, I wouldn't have lost..."
